i3psycho 1.0
============

First release. Verified by the shipped test scripts (test/) and by
upstream i3's complete test suite (284 files, 4190 tests, PASS) running
against the patched binary.

Fork: four patches on upstream i3 (patches/)
 - window::move IPC events for floating repositions
 - titlebar buttons on floating windows (close / iconify / maximize),
   double-click titlebar fullscreen
 - live edge-snap preview and exact snap-on-drop in the drag loop
 - iconify requests honored; scratchpad windows expose
   _NET_WM_STATE_HIDDEN and WM_STATE Iconic

psychod:
 - cascade placement, exact workarea snapping, minimize with geometry
   restore, drop-snap for stock i3, MRU cycling, expose grid, show
   desktop, hot corners
 - survives i3 restarts, one instance per display, action failures are
   logged instead of fatal
 - psychod-status wraps any statusline and adds clickable chips for
   minimized windows

Distribution:
 - PKGBUILD (provides/conflicts i3-wm), xsession entry, session launcher
 - psycho.conf include for existing configs, psycho.config standalone
 - userguide.txt, psychod(1), vsync-only picom.conf
